# ⛔ NEVER commit public/bank/index.html. `expo export` writes the RN app's entry
# point as index.html; a file there is served STATICALLY for /bank and /bank/ and
# WINS over the App Router page (src/app/bank/page.tsx) — silently replacing the
# 6-exam catalog + sign-in with the RN MockHub. Regressed twice already (fixed in
# 09f3f9f, reintroduced by the Jul 29 re-export). The player's copy is
# player.html, which maps to no /bank/* url. See CLOUDFLARE_DEPLOY.md.
public/bank/index.html
